Preserve the existing search experience.

Requirements:

* Search input should be available at the top of the dropdown.
* Search should filter options based on the entered text.
* Search should be case-insensitive.
* Search should support partial matches.
* The search input should remain usable while selecting multiple options.
* Search should not clear previously selected values.
* Clearing the search should restore the complete option list.
* ALL should be handled separately according to the showAllOption configuration.

If the ICGDS Select component already supports search internally, use that functionality instead of implementing a duplicate search mechanism.

